WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.465
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:11.466 --> 00:00:14.743
I'm a porcupine.

3
00:00:14.744 --> 00:00:18.877
Porcupines are large rodents.

4
00:00:18.878 --> 00:00:24.007
Rodents have sharp front teeth.

5
00:00:24.008 --> 00:00:27.133
Where do you live?

6
00:00:27.134 --> 00:00:32.538
Porcupines live all over the world.

7
00:00:32.539 --> 00:00:36.938
Some like forests or caves.

8
00:00:36.939 --> 00:00:42.500
We live in snowbanks and the desert too.

9
00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:45.735
What do you eat?

10
00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:49.854
Many porcupines like bark.

11
00:00:49.855 --> 00:00:55.756
We bite it with our big teeth.

12
00:00:55.757 --> 00:01:00.301
We also like grass and fruit.

13
00:01:00.302 --> 00:01:06.310
You have needles on your fur!

14
00:01:06.311 --> 00:01:09.579
Those are my quills.

15
00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:16.271
They are very sharp!

16
00:01:16.272 --> 00:01:20.024
Why do you have quills?

17
00:01:20.025 --> 00:01:24.066
Our quills protect us.

18
00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:29.191
They lie flat unless an enemy comes near.

19
00:01:29.192 --> 00:01:34.144
Then our quills pop up!

20
00:01:34.145 --> 00:01:37.837
What do the quills do then?

21
00:01:37.838 --> 00:01:42.258
They can stick into enemies' skin.

22
00:01:42.259 --> 00:01:47.080
They are very hard to get out.

23
00:01:47.081 --> 00:01:50.867
And they hurt!

24
00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:54.209
Can you climb trees?

25
00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:59.497
Many porcupines are good climbers.

26
00:01:59.498 --> 00:02:07.201
But others stay on the ground.

27
00:02:07.202 --> 00:02:11.962
I see some grass.

28
00:02:11.963 --> 00:02:17.103
It's time to eat.

29
00:02:17.104 --> 00:02:24.433
See you later, Porcupine!

